    "reason": "The linked PR [ev-1ed1c62f196d] explains more than the one-line note [ev-6f2ab5d1b975]. It adds an optional annotation on Functions that `crossplane render` reads, and the Docker runtime then sets matching key=value environment variables in the function container. Because this is opt-in and additive, the change type (added) and the consequence (nothing happens if the operator does nothing) can be inferred. However, no excerpt gives the annotation key or its value format, so the subject cannot be written as a comparable identifier. The changed-files list [ev-43e17bb36da1] shows only file names, and the docs PR (crossplane/docs#910) that would name the key is not shown, so the exact annotation key is the missing piece.",
